name wsd-data
# A data set of the framework: texts of sentences, each sentence the words it is made of. The file does not write a
# sentence as text: a sentence is the path of its words, in order. What is said of a word (its lemma, its pos, and for
# an instance its id) is said of the word, within its sentence.
# The ids are the data set's own: d000.s000.t000 is a different word in SemCor, in senseval2 and in semeval2013. An id
# is therefore recorded within its data set, which is the directory the file is in, as the framework names it.
match *.data.xml
grammar xml
identity text id kind {dir}
identity sentence id kind {dir}
refer instance.id {dir}
words sentence wf instance
